38237>>>>>>>        Else Begin
38238>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38239>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38240>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38241>>>>>>>        End
