38411>>>>>                Case Break
38412>>>>>
38412>>>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38412>>>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38412>>>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
38412>>>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38413>>>>>
38413>>>>>        Case End
