38849>>>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38852>>>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38852>>>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38852>>>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38852>>>>>>>        Handle hoDD
38852>>>>>>>
38852>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38853>>>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38854>>>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38855>>>>>>>
38855>>>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38855>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38856>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38857>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38858>>>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38859>>>>>>>
38859>>>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
38861>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
38862>>>>>>>        End
38862>>>>>>>>
38862>>>>>>>        Else Begin
38863>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38864>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38865>>>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38866>>>>>>>        End
38866>>>>>>>>
38866>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
